sequenceDiagram
  participant A as {{users.role.admin}} in the web interface
  participant CP as Control plane
  participant H as Agent on the host
  A->>CP: 1. {{hosts.addTitle}}
  CP-->>A: 2. register command with a one-time token
  A->>H: 3. run register on the host
  H->>H: 4. make a key pair and a CSR
  H->>CP: 5. HTTPS 443: token and CSR
  CP-->>H: 6. certificate, CA chain, job signing keys
  H->>H: 7. pin the root CA, start the service
  H->>CP: 8. gRPC stream, mTLS 8443
  CP-->>A: 9. {{hosts.status.online}}
